msgstr "Przy długich nagraniach może to potrwać do minuty."

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:9
msgid "Analysis controls"
msgstr "Panel analizy"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:12
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/cleaning_main.html:14
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ustawienia"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:15
msgid "Synchronization settings"
msgstr "Ustawienia synchronizacji"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:18
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:27
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Ustawienia zaawansowane"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:24
msgid "Co-arousal settings"
msgstr "Ustawienia ko-pobudzenia"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:33
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/cleaning_main.html:45
msgid "Apply settings"
msgstr "Zastosuj ustawienia"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:34
msgid ""
"Applying settings runs the analysis again: one run computes both "
"synchronization and co-arousal with the cleaning settings from step 2."
msgstr ""
"Zastosowanie ustawień ponownie uruchamia analizę: jedno uruchomienie liczy "
"synchronizację i ko-pobudzenie z ustawieniami czyszczenia z kroku 2."

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:36
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/cleaning_main.html:48
msgid "Reset defaults"
msgstr "Przywróć domyślne"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:44
msgid "Select at least two signals to compute synchronization."
msgstr "Wybierz co najmniej dwa sygnały, aby policzyć synchronizację."

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:48
msgid "Analysis results"
msgstr "Wyniki analizy"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:51
msgid "No results for this step yet. Set the parameters and run the analysis."
msgstr "Brak wyników dla tego kroku. Ustaw parametry i uruchom analizę."

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:52 gsr/tests/test_views.py:698
msgid "Run analysis"
msgstr "Uruchom analizę"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:55
msgid "Settings or signals changed since this run. Run the analysis again."
msgstr ""
"Ustawienia lub sygnały zmieniły się od tego obliczenia. Uruchom analizę "
"ponownie."

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:59
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/export_main.html:36
msgid "Synchronization"
msgstr "Synchronizacja"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:60
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/export_main.html:42
msgid "Co-arousal"
msgstr "Ko-pobudzenie"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:64
msgid ""
"We look for fragments where signals begin to synchronize and group them into "
"clusters."
msgstr ""
"Szukamy fragmentów, w których sygnały zaczynają się synchronizować, i "
"grupujemy je w klastry."

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:67
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:149
msgid "Mean synchrony"
msgstr "Średnia synchronizacja"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:69
msgid "Whole-group test"
msgstr "Test całej grupy"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:73
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:176
msgid "Episode count"
msgstr "Liczba epizodów"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:74
msgid "Cluster count"
msgstr "Liczba klastrów"

#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:77
#: gsr/templates/gsr/partials/analysis_main.html:78
msgid "Synchronization timeline"
